HOOLHEYAKMOD-COMPOSE.description:
Until the end of this turn, [gold]Variable[/gold]:
Reduce the cost of a card in your hand by 3;
Reduce the cost of all cards in your hand by 1.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-RECURSIVE_EXPERIMENT.descri:
[gold]Variable[/gold]:
End the experiment;
Play a random card from your deck and permanently remove it from your deck. After combat, gain an additional card reward of the same type, then continue the experiment.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-REDUNDANT_EXPERIMENT.descri:
Choose up to {Redundant-Count:diff()} cards in your hand. [gold]Variable[/gold]:
Shuffle, then discard them;
Shuffle, then put them on top of your draw pile.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-FORBIDDEN_KNOWLEDGE.descrip:
[gold]Variable[/gold]:
Whenever you trigger [gold]Erudition[/gold], draw 1 additional card;
Whenever you trigger [gold]Meander[/gold], deal 5 damage to ALL enemies.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-ANCIENT_COVENANT.descriptio:
[gold]Variable[/gold]:
Whenever you trigger [gold]Erudition[/gold], gain {Covenant-Magic:diff()} [gold]Strength[/gold];
Whenever you trigger [gold]Meander[/gold], gain {Covenant-Magic:diff()} [gold]Dexterity[/gold].

HOOLHEYAKMOD-CHIMERA_EXPERIMENT.descript:
Play the top {IfUpgraded:show:X+1|X} cards of the chosen type in your draw pile. [gold]Variable[/gold]:
Attacks;
Skills.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-CROSS_SEARCH.description:
Draw {CrossSearch-Draw:diff()} cards. Discard 1 card.
If you discard an Attack, gain 1 [gold]Erudition[/gold];
If you discard a Skill, gain 1 [gold]Meander[/gold].

HOOLHEYAKMOD-PUTRID_OBLATION.description:
This turn, [gold]Variable[/gold]:
Lose all Block and cannot gain Block. Draw {PutridOblation-Draw:diff()} cards and gain {PutridOblation-Energy:diff()} Energy;
Cannot draw cards. Gain {Block:diff()} Block and {PutridOblation-Energy:diff()} Energy;
Cannot gain Energy. Gain {Block:diff()} Block and draw {PutridOblation-Draw:diff()} cards.

HOOLHEYAKMOD-ECDYSIS.description:
Whenever you remove a debuff, gain 1 [gold]Analysis[/gold] and [gold]Variable[/gold]:
1 [gold]Strength[/gold];
1 [gold]Dexterity[/gold].
